{"title":"나는 최강","artist":"Vaundy","sourceId":"reference:ZX7HAgr6p4zEuhBAyYA4","sourceHash":"141c9f008ef58274733d4f67e257f9c6c819eeb2fc83892fa8672130f734d7d9","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":3912169,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":1.95,"end":6.3,"text":"さぁ 怖くはない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":6.3,"end":8.76,"text":"不安はない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":8.76,"end":13.71,"text":"私の夢は みんなの願い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":13.71,"end":18.67,"text":"歌唄えば ココロ晴れる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":18.67,"end":24.06,"text":"大丈夫よ 私は最強","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":32.63,"end":35.28,"text":"私の声が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":35.28,"end":37.72,"text":"小鳥を空へ運ぶ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":37.72,"end":42.84,"text":"靡いた服も踊り子みたいでさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":42.84,"end":45.42,"text":"あなたの声が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":45.42,"end":47.81,"text":"私を奮い立たせる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":47.81,"end":52.76,"text":"トゲが刺さってしまったなら ほらほらおいで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":52.76,"end":57.56,"text":"見たことない 新しい景色","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":57.56,"end":60.25,"text":"絶対に観れるの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":60.25,"end":62.51,"text":"なぜならば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":62.51,"end":65.27,"text":"生きてるんだ今日も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":65.27,"end":68.52,"text":"さぁ 握る手と手","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":68.52,"end":71.28999999999999,"text":"ヒカリの方へ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":71.28999999999999,"end":75.43,"text":"みんなの夢は 私の幸せ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":75.43,"end":81.02,"text":"あぁ きっとどこにもない アナタしか持ってない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":81.02,"end":87.2,"text":"その温もりで 私は最強","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":95.17,"end":97.99000000000001,"text":"回り道でも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":97.99000000000001,"end":100.1,"text":"私が歩けば正解","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":100.1,"end":102.41,"text":"わかっているけど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":102.41,"end":105.22,"text":"引くに引けなくてさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":105.22,"end":108.72,"text":"無理はちょっとしてでも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":108.72,"end":112.4,"text":"花に水はあげたいわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":112.4,"end":116.28999999999999,"text":"そうやっぱ したいことしなきゃ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":116.28999999999999,"end":124.09,"text":"腐るでしょう？ 期待には応えるの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":126.36,"end":131.27,"text":"いつか来るだろう 素晴らしき時代","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":131.27,"end":136.45,"text":"今はただ待ってる 誰かをね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":136.45,"end":141.21,"text":"繰り返してる 傷ましい苦味","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":141.21,"end":146.37,"text":"火を灯す準備は出来てるの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":146.37,"end":148.91,"text":"いざ行かん 最高峰","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":148.91,"end":152.42000000000002,"text":"さぁ 怖くはない？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":152.42000000000002,"end":155.04,"text":"不安はない？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":155.04,"end":159.94,"text":"私の思いは 皆んなには重い？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":159.94,"end":164.71,"text":"歌唄えば 霧も晴れる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":164.71,"end":170.75,"text":"見事なまでに 私は最恐","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":188.95,"end":192.38,"text":"さぁ 握る手と手","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":192.38,"end":194.83,"text":"ヒカリの方へ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":194.83,"end":199.56,"text":"みんなの夢は 私の願い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":199.56,"end":204.85,"text":"きっとどこにもない アナタしか持ってない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":204.85,"end":209.09,"text":"その弱さが 照らすの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":209.09,"end":212.32,"text":"最愛の日々","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":212.32,"end":214.96,"text":"忘れぬ誓い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":214.96,"end":220.37,"text":"いつかの夢が 私の心臓","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":220.37,"end":227.25,"text":"何度でも 何度でも 言うわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":227.25,"end":232.06,"text":"「私は最強」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":232.06,"end":236.27,"text":"「アナタと最強」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":247.1,"end":252.77,"text":"「アナタと最強」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}